# ── Registry ──
Registry.Chance: Chance
Registry.Chance.Detail: Each game, every slot of this role is rolled separately at this chance. 100% always appears; 0% never does. When "Players left without a role" fills them, this is also the weight used to hand out leftover roles.
Registry.Count: Count
