# ════ SuperNewRoles から移した役職 ════
# ── メイヤー (Mayor) ──
Mayor.Name: Mayor
Mayor.Blurb: That power will save the village
Mayor.Summary: A crewmate who casts more votes than anyone else in meetings.
Mayor.Votes: Number of votes
# ── マッドメイト (Madmate) ──
Madmate.Name: Madmate
Madmate.Blurb: One who has strayed from the path
Madmate.Summary: A crewmate on the impostors' side.
Madmate.WinCond: Win when the impostors win, dead or alive
Madmate.KnowImpostors: Can know the impostors
Madmate.NeededTasks: Tasks needed to know them
Madmate.CanVent: Can use vents
Madmate.ImpostorVision: Has impostor vision
# ── シェリフ (Sheriff) ──
Sheriff.Name: Sheriff
Sheriff.Blurb: In the name of justice
Sheriff.Summary: A crewmate who can execute a nearby player. If the target isn't on a team you may kill, you die instead.
Sheriff.Execute: Execute
Sheriff.Execute.Help: Kills a nearby player. If they aren't on a team you're allowed to kill, you die instead (depends on the suicide setting).
Sheriff.Execute.Short: Execute a nearby player
Sheriff.KillCooldown: Execute cooldown
Sheriff.MaxKills: Executions
Sheriff.SuicideMode: Suicide mode
Sheriff.SuicideMode.Default: Only on a wrong target
Sheriff.SuicideMode.AlwaysSuicide: Always die with the target
Sheriff.SuicideMode.AlwaysKill: Never die
Sheriff.KillImpostor: Can kill impostors
Sheriff.KillMad: Can kill madmates
Sheriff.KillNeutral: Can kill neutrals
Sheriff.KillFriends: Can kill friends
Sheriff.KillLovers: Can kill lovers
# ── 霊媒師 (Seer) ──
Seer.Name: Seer
Seer.Blurb: Hear the voices of souls
Seer.Summary: A crewmate whose screen flashes when someone dies and who sees souls where people died.
Seer.Mode: Mode
Seer.Mode.Both: Flash and souls
Seer.Mode.Flash: Flash only
Seer.Mode.Soul: Souls only
Seer.LimitSoul: Souls fade over time
Seer.SoulDuration: Soul duration
# ── ジャッカル (Jackal) ──
Jackal.Name: Jackal
Jackal.Blurb: Hunt everything with your pack
Jackal.Summary: A neutral killer who can recruit a partner once.
Jackal.WinCond: Win when only the Jackal's pack is left alive
Jackal.Kill: Kill
Jackal.Kill.Help: Has the vanilla kill button. Vision and kill distance follow the Neutral settings in the Game Settings tab. Cannot kill your pack.
Jackal.Kill.Short: Has the kill button
Jackal.Sidekick: Sidekick
Jackal.Sidekick.Help: Turns a nearby player into your partner (Sidekick or Jackal Friends), once.
Jackal.Sidekick.Short: Recruit a nearby player
Jackal.KillCooldown: Kill cooldown
Jackal.CanVent: Can use vents
Jackal.CanSidekick: Can recruit
Jackal.SidekickCooldown: Recruit cooldown
Jackal.Infinite: Promoted Jackals can recruit too
# ── サイドキック (Sidekick) ──
Sidekick.Name: Sidekick
Sidekick.Blurb: The Jackal's right hand
Sidekick.Summary: A neutral recruited by the Jackal. Cannot kill, and becomes a Jackal when all Jackals are dead.
Sidekick.WinCond: Win when the Jackal wins
Sidekick.CanVent: Can use vents
# ── ベイト (Bait) ──
Bait.Name: Bait
Bait.Blurb: Who fell into the trap?
Bait.Summary: A crewmate whose killer reports their body shortly after the kill.
Bait.ReportTime: Time until report
Bait.WarnKiller: Flash the killer's screen
Bait.RandomDelay: Randomize the report delay
Bait.DelayVariation: Maximum extra delay
# ── ラバーズ (Lovers) ──
Lovers.Name: Lovers
Lovers.Blurb: Our love is forever
Lovers.Summary: An add-on given to a pair. You know your partner (♥ by their name), and you die when they die.
Lovers.WinCond: If both are alive at the end, you steal the win together
Lovers.FollowDeath: Die when your partner dies
Lovers.SoloWin: Steal the win if both are alive
# ── ヴァルチャー (Vulture) ──
Vulture.Name: Vulture
Vulture.Blurb: Feast on the dead
Vulture.Summary: A neutral who eats bodies to erase them. Eat enough to win alone.
Vulture.WinCond: Win alone the moment you've eaten enough bodies
Vulture.Eat: Eat
Vulture.Eat.Help: Eats and removes a body within report range. You see arrows to bodies (option).
Vulture.Eat.Short: Eat a nearby body
Vulture.Cooldown: Eat cooldown
Vulture.RequiredBodies: Bodies needed to win
Vulture.CanVent: Can use vents
Vulture.Count: Bodies eaten {n}/{max}
# ── アーソニスト (Arsonist) ──
Arsonist.Name: Arsonist
Arsonist.Blurb: Burn it all to ashes
Arsonist.Summary: A neutral who wins by dousing everyone in oil and setting it alight.
Arsonist.WinCond: Win alone by dousing every living player and igniting
Arsonist.Douse: Douse
Arsonist.Douse.Help: Stay next to a nearby person for a moment to douse them. Moving away or a different nearest person cancels it. Doused people are marked §.
Arsonist.Douse.Short: Douse a nearby player
Arsonist.Ignite: Ignite
Arsonist.Ignite.Help: If every other living player is doused, ignite to win alone.
Arsonist.Ignite.Short: Ignite to win once all are doused
Arsonist.Cooldown: Douse cooldown
Arsonist.CanVent: Can use vents
Arsonist.ImpostorVision: Has impostor vision
# ── カモフラージャー (Camouflager) ──
Camouflager.Name: Camouflager
Camouflager.Blurb: Who is who?
Camouflager.Summary: An impostor who can make everyone look like them for a while.
Camouflager.Camo: Camouflage
Camouflager.Camo.Help: For a set time, every living player looks like you.
Camouflager.Camo.Short: Make everyone look alike
Camouflager.Cooldown: Camouflage cooldown
Camouflager.Duration: Camouflage duration
# ── トリガーハッピー (TriggerHappy) ──
TriggerHappy.Name: Trigger Happy
TriggerHappy.Blurb: Shoot, shoot, and keep shooting
TriggerHappy.Summary: An impostor who sprays a machine gun for a while and kills anyone hit by enough bullets.
TriggerHappy.Spray: Spray
TriggerHappy.Spray.Help: Hold a machine gun for a while and keep spraying bullets toward the mouse. Anyone hit enough times dies. Bullets stop at walls (unless set to pierce) and bounce off a Wise Man's barrier.
TriggerHappy.Spray.Short: Spray the machine gun
TriggerHappy.Cooldown: Spray cooldown
TriggerHappy.Range: Bullet range
# ── ミラージュ (Mirage) ──
RolePicker.Crew: Crew
RolePicker.Impostor: Impostor
RolePicker.Neutral: Neutral
RolePicker.Close: Close
RolePicker.SearchHint: Search roles
RolePicker.NoMatch: No matching roles
RolePicker.Pick: Pick a role
RolePicker.Confirm: Press {role} again to shoot
GuessKit.Hit: {name} was shot
GuessKit.Missed: {name} guessed wrong and was shot
# ── ナイスゲッサー (NiceGuesser) ──
NiceGuesser.Name: Nice Guesser
NiceGuesser.Blurb: I see what you really are
NiceGuesser.Summary: A crewmate who can shoot by guessing roles in meetings. A wrong guess kills them.
NiceGuesser.Shoot: Shoot
NiceGuesser.Shoot.Help: In a meeting, pick a player and guess their role. If right, they die; if wrong, you die.
NiceGuesser.Shoot.Short: Guess a role and shoot
NiceGuesser.Shots: Total shots
NiceGuesser.PerMeeting: Shots per meeting
# ── イビルゲッサー (EvilGuesser) ──
EvilGuesser.Name: Evil Guesser
EvilGuesser.Blurb: The meeting is my hunting ground
EvilGuesser.Summary: An impostor who can shoot by guessing roles in meetings. A wrong guess kills them.
EvilGuesser.Shoot: Shoot
EvilGuesser.Shoot.Help: In a meeting, pick a player and guess their role. If right, they die; if wrong, you die.
EvilGuesser.Shoot.Short: Guess a role and shoot
EvilGuesser.Shots: Total shots
EvilGuesser.PerMeeting: Shots per meeting
# ── ホスフォラス (Phosphorus) ──
Phosphorus.Name: Phosphorus
Phosphorus.Blurb: A lantern against the dark
Phosphorus.Summary: A crewmate who places lanterns and lights them up.
Phosphorus.Put: Place
Phosphorus.Put.Help: Places a lantern where you stand. Everyone can see it from the next round.
Phosphorus.Put.Short: Place a lantern
Phosphorus.Light: Light
Phosphorus.Light.Help: Lights your lanterns for a while, brightening their surroundings (press again to turn off).
Phosphorus.Light.Short: Light the lanterns
Phosphorus.Cooldown: Place cooldown
Phosphorus.Limit: Lantern limit
Phosphorus.LightCooldown: Light cooldown
Phosphorus.Duration: Light duration
Phosphorus.Range: Light range
# ── マッシュルーマー (Mushroomer) ──
Mushroomer.Name: Mushroomer
Mushroomer.Blurb: Smother them in spores
Mushroomer.Summary: An impostor who plants mushrooms and makes every mushroom on the ship burst with spores. Works on any map.
Mushroomer.Plant: Plant
Mushroomer.Plant.Help: Plants a mushroom at your feet. It becomes active after the next meeting (impostors see it faintly).
Mushroomer.Plant.Short: Plant a mushroom
Mushroomer.Explode: Burst
Mushroomer.Explode.Help: Usable once all your mushrooms are planted and active. Every active mushroom on the ship bursts with spores at once.
Mushroomer.Explode.Short: Burst all mushrooms
Mushroomer.HasGasMask: Has a gas mask
Mushroomer.PlantCooldown: Plant cooldown
Mushroomer.PlantCount: Mushrooms to plant
Mushroomer.ExplodeCooldown: Burst cooldown
Mushroomer.ExplodeCount: Burst uses
Mushroomer.ExplodeRange: Spore range
Mushroomer.ExplodeDuration: Spore duration
Mushroomer.ActiveUsedMushroom: Planted mushrooms visible only to you
# ── リモコン (RemoteController) ──
RemoteController.Name: Remote Controller
RemoteController.Blurb: You move as I please
RemoteController.Summary: An impostor who controls a crewmate's movement and makes them kill.
RemoteController.Mark: Mark
RemoteController.Mark.Help: Picks a nearby crewmate to control.
RemoteController.Mark.Short: Pick who to control
RemoteController.Operate: Operate
RemoteController.Operate.Help: For a while (or without limit), you move the marked person. Neither of you can move on your own meanwhile. Press again to stop.
RemoteController.Operate.Short: Move the marked person
RemoteController.Kill: Remote Kill
RemoteController.Kill.Help: While operating: the person you control kills someone near them. Ends the operation.
RemoteController.Kill.Short: Make your puppet kill
RemoteController.MarkCooldown: Mark cooldown
RemoteController.OperationInfinite: Unlimited operation
RemoteController.OperationDuration: Operation duration
# ── ロケットランチャー (RocketLauncher) ──
RocketLauncher.Name: Rocket Launcher
RocketLauncher.Blurb: Human rocket, launch!
RocketLauncher.Summary: An impostor who grabs a crewmate and launches them to explode on impact.
RocketLauncher.Load: Load
RocketLauncher.Load.Help: Grabs a nearby crewmate. They cannot move and are carried with you.
RocketLauncher.Load.Short: Grab a crewmate
RocketLauncher.Shot: Launch
RocketLauncher.Shot.Help: Launches the grabbed person the way you face. On hitting a wall (or a person, by setting) they explode, killing those nearby. If a meeting starts, the held or flying person dies.
RocketLauncher.Shot.Short: Launch the grabbed person
RocketLauncher.Cooldown: Load cooldown
RocketLauncher.CollideWithPlayers: Explodes on hitting people
RocketLauncher.KillImpostors: Explosion kills impostors
RocketLauncher.ExplosionRange: Explosion range
RocketLauncher.LimitLoadedTime: Limit holding time
RocketLauncher.LoadedTimeLimit: Holding time
RocketLauncher.CanUseNormalKill: Can kill normally
# ── 突き落と師 (Pusher) ──
Pusher.Name: Pusher
Pusher.Blurb: Watch your step
Pusher.Summary: An impostor who pushes people standing at the ship's edges or atop ladders (Skeld, Polus, Airship, Fungle).
Pusher.Push: Push
Pusher.Push.Help: Pushes a crewmate standing at a ship edge (fixed spots). They fall and leave no body. Pushing someone atop a ladder leaves their body at the bottom.
Pusher.Push.Short: Push someone off an edge
Pusher.Cooldown: Push cooldown
# ── ユビキタス (Ubiquitous) ──
Ubiquitous.Name: Ubiquitous
Ubiquitous.Blurb: Drones are everywhere
Ubiquitous.Summary: A crewmate who flies a drone to watch and open doors.
Ubiquitous.Call: Call / Return
Ubiquitous.Call.Help: Spawns a drone at your feet. Press again to remove it. When a meeting starts, a flying drone stops where it is and stays for the set number of meetings. People near your stopped drones show on the map.
Ubiquitous.Call.Short: Call a drone
Ubiquitous.Operate: Operate
Ubiquitous.Operate.Help: Pilot the drone. You cannot move while doing so; the camera follows the drone and you can see around it.
Ubiquitous.Operate.Short: Fly the drone
Ubiquitous.DoorHack: Hack Doors
Ubiquitous.DoorHack.Help: While piloting, opens closed doors near the drone.
Ubiquitous.DoorHack.Short: Open nearby doors
Ubiquitous.CallCooldown: Call cooldown
Ubiquitous.OperateCooldown: Operate cooldown
Ubiquitous.LimitOperate: Limit operating time
Ubiquitous.OperateTime: Operating time
Ubiquitous.StayTurns: Meetings a drone stays
Ubiquitous.FlyingSpeed: Drone speed
Ubiquitous.DoorHackCooldown: Door hack cooldown
Ubiquitous.DoorHackScope: Door hack range
Ubiquitous.VisibilityRange: Drone vision range
Ubiquitous.MapShowColor: Show colors on the map
